   "width": 421.85,
   "height": 113.75,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "GET/POST /api/videos · PATCH /api/videos/[id] (watched)\nPOST /api/videos/[id]/summarize | ask | transcript\nPOST /api/channels (resolve → confirm → backfill) · RE-SYNC\nCRUD /api/genres (color, ask_prompt)\nPOST /api/login (rate-limited)\nGET /api/cron — x-cron-secret header OR auth cookie\nevery route checks auth · never mutate on GET",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "GET/POST /api/videos · PATCH /api/videos/[id] (watched)\nPOST /api/videos/[id]/summarize | ask | transcript\nPOST /api/channels (resolve → confirm → backfill) · RE-SYNC\nCRUD /api/genres (color, ask_prompt)\nPOST /api/login (rate-limited)\nGET /api/cron — x-cron-secret header OR auth cookie\nevery route checks auth · never mutate on GET",
