   "height": 151.25,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "model chain GEMINI_MODELS\nranked by remaining RPD\n(gemini_usage ledger, UTC reset)\n429/404 → next model\nGEMINI_DAILY_LIMIT=100/day cap\ntext Q&A ≈ 5–15K tokens\nwatch-once: fps 0.1 + LOW res\n≈ 40 tok/s, ≤ 90 min, LOCAL only\n(disabled on Netlify → honest\n\"no captions\" fail-fast)\ncaches transcript on video row",
